{
  "4": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:20f1dc5aa5be936c1c52fbe7806cc549da7ecd91a8f577da7111742b79c556c8",
      "text": "So from now on, you are not to call\nyourself a priest! Never again shall\nyou mock the Church of Farlana—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:08667b499cdf59082fd01b977f59eb1d8c73288d04fe654e2c7887c6dc217d6d",
      "text": "...Understood. I won't say the\nstar-something thing anymore.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7228d55318a7909e2ae309b7a0e86f65e729b0bec0383d7654031cc34fbaede6",
      "text": "Were you even listening?! And\n\"star-something\"?! Of all the\nimpudence!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c9438a5015f3fa2f2dbf92fb783e1dbd0194fdb6572acda44caf08f050062f1",
      "text": "What a pain...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5e351ca38c9d6b6e71befe59a7b76f19157004ba710e4817aac9df8caa7f66e2",
      "text": "Oh, it's you. ...What was the\nproblem just now?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe5193d6c5e97af045a379bfed598842d48143fdee0c9db5b7539455660d911a",
      "text": "Hmm... Pretty much all of it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3bd4201263f2788f528cac40c8674c0f0df33866f689c9ccde2661af59ac407b",
      "text": "I don't get it...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cfcf92771d5d494f06884bd675c4b8d1380e6074a71c315151d49d63a963f9c7",
      "text": "Bet that kind of thing happens to\nyou a lot, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4a04a1c26cbab0d2ff686036a66ab58b2e0e40041e29ae11f532da6c29de3262",
      "text": "...I get complaints often. I thought\nI was keeping to myself...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bb75c3d7efc1190806214f4143cd1c507b66897134a711c0dcb3f0b80bbb2ca6",
      "text": "Watch me for a while. Tell me what\nI'm doing wrong.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:41cd70f9e71e7d3b01e0fc9f80d1bd4da275401c8ab3dbb5b58caa9b1a289c56",
      "text": "A gravekeeper looks after and keeps\nwatch over the cemetery. ...I thought\nI could at least handle patrols.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:27edfd0527e09612c37d49dff500513f98b11f5faa78e917113218d0a468af79",
      "text": "...Did you call yourself a priest\nbecause it seemed to go with being\na gravekeeper?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:53f187236c5fd14089551c89fc78a41257d08eccc3543e39a9085f8bf2113ec3",
      "text": "...That, and I thought it would help\nme blend in as an ordinary citizen.\nApparently not.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f96bec85c78c782892f8cceb002c6ff68a5ed8942485a79fb551f88985d86519",
      "text": "Your whole idea and your cover story\nare sloppy, is what I'm saying—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4113fc21f4198e8708c57d822eb4640c5bd5239f243bb1be0217d0391ca6e148",
      "text": "Cr-crap. Someone's here...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edb81c83dabe6047b1cfe461aea9e28f4439c68a850e203d66ba865c0ecc3391",
      "text": "Hey. What are you up to?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:800bee3e15d3d90258e3993437e8f8cc070d4fc7ad058755ff120cad1e1108b2",
      "text": "Oh, n-no, nothing! We just got a\nbit lost! W-we'll be leaving right—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:26205dcc44173ef3193d031dff334b260c3e1f4a268ce25e3c84f4f70fffdb0f",
      "text": "Grave robbers. Enemies, then?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4cdad9096c9137b84e797c5db699252163a340b101b978600d81e2a22579c4b8",
      "text": "Hey!!? You're the one driving the\npeace away, you know!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:125dbddd56c08817944579203312a2bfbc9c09878c07f78a2af4ef4f993a3724",
      "text": "Isn't it fine as long as\nI don't kill them?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f01156720e3e43834175fbdc37f70cf6f09b3145a62c1695016ac66c898b5d8",
      "text": "They obviously weren't hostile...\nYou're just making more work for\nyourself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dc7d8bcc9bc4daa9e8d15c90e9573474951ef372811abc1a6b2bf9e4ed4b6b10",
      "text": "...If I were an ordinary citizen.\nWhat would I usually do next?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:373a8e95948e0d8fba78c1652b0f75f55511d889363d2b49a9888869119255ee",
      "text": "Um... F-for a start, fix\nwhat you broke...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6e65bf37a63c600908f5ac534eb0ee7fe66ca8223d7d0c62f143cb9e8f1b5cff",
      "text": "I'll treat your injuries later.\nStay here. Don't move.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "100": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f7b964aed59a371171f3537b26d3d04740715bd55e324cb7e6e984464934c51c",
      "text": "Gravestones and fences to repair...\nIt really is more of a pain...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:000ccc31e8143331ec9d20b91930c69a895365bf8172727133d20244b0e4380e",
      "text": "Is he lazy, or just honest...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "109": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c44b55c5537e44c31f441703c00bd7b3dc7cf465e54372a69450997a6852a44",
      "text": "I don't get him...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7dff347ed8753a697e9a3832534c2283fe9c207845e8f547da0700a2c374e168",
      "text": "...Don't attack people who aren't\nhostile. If they are, think before\nfighting back right away...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:14905d06629007c01c19a06d62da4e42406e9fabd05ebcfd6ac8ae19d737aef9",
      "text": "Being an ordinary citizen is\nnothing but a pain...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "121": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cd3ae633de5d1a40ec979fa40a8f2495a5a1e2fa59c1b9daa627f90f6e807d58",
      "text": "\"Hit them first\" really is your\ndefault, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:783fd4510bad191da57696691a6c6f102a05fcb0397eaed781194b48fb254cf1",
      "text": "Look, do you really wanna be one?\nA peaceful ordinary citizen?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d0265cffada9b4014269e9895c511d2882514c4f8c5e09642e3eb1cc5a6c2a90",
      "text": "You keep saying you do. But your\nway of doing things and this town\njust don't mix, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:93fd5765762ab221ee0ffe33568da13efcb062687a31db0732b91a0e833ad63d",
      "text": "Huh, Iores? You two know each\nother?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:89ee1a4269f21e805e6be54ec994b7f7d15bfc9d5484748fe1cc44f64e29f40f",
      "text": "Ernest? You two know each other,\ntoo...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:75b0926a95b295a0add3801c4bb598d822d8ab683323d8782a298bbd3d8726ca",
      "text": "...He gave me an apple.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2e8da205933083e157983798496efaabf31ca645401ce43939262f0f4ddeef88",
      "text": "When I first came to this town, he\nspoke to me. He said he was worried,\nseeing me on my own.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:02dd313497cc4a135ac1a1ed1d302e689c1f013d4cf57daba2117f22f1a6bef4",
      "text": "Then he handed me an apple.\n...I didn't understand why.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:941b6a6e8bcbbcd60dfedd51a2f8637cfe67ca3165b3d2fc160aa037275bd2bd",
      "text": "I got a ton as thanks for a job,\nso I just shared some. Call it a\n\"welcome to town.\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a430a729abf65f00ace5d397f7acd9b5e1e60488bb040146bfd6ad05e35c421",
      "text": ".........\nAren't you busy today?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e391cdc475f20affb11d7954c48c0450e252ef213bcffce6f50497ccbec5ffd1",
      "text": "Ah, well, I've got another job after\nthis. Too bad, but I have to go.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9cca01751ab5355bd61b0e022a8399af3644ccec9528279d51598a799bfbe699",
      "text": "...Why is it too bad?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:efeea2fbd15eb1eabb615bf31f626f9eba0e652a9b1431369804daa45330102e",
      "text": "See you both, then. Next time I'd\nlove it if you let me join in.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62cc996684bce0f09b88e03401081d6b8c1b5afb66439e1226c117779dd0dfa6",
      "text": "What a smooth talker. Kind of the\nexact opposite of you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c9d9692fa3ba601b66acc3237c52415b735c9630f6810664c89612e94337b104",
      "text": "When he gave me the apple,\nI decided.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:698768b69fa85d37888b80fba782623910ccf67503c5312dde74ecf8e3169d04",
      "text": "The organization, taking orders...\nit was all a pain. But I knew\nnothing else.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2894080ef0113803df40ecaa682b65ce59b487833273e8e64f0c54765aa4736d",
      "text": "...I first came here to kill\nsomeone. And I was given an apple.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3eb8c9fb0f4881070df352f7899ab52a25dd83223154dafa786b07a2df5e79e9",
      "text": "I decided to live in this town.\nTo become one of the people here.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "188": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0305a83fdf1091435d3ead6314dc6909383289c3fbbd76d3e70e1ec52d0b0338",
      "text": "...One of the people here...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:14b55a44ee038580688c9022714d740f825798bb71e58695c79f66a2b7a25148",
      "text": "You said you didn't want to choose\nto kill.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2eda9a3a9b9b624d2acb7e2fca40c130de4f63962725d819f2bdf5efcf07b883",
      "text": "Just like with that man earlier...\nI felt I could see something\nin you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5a074e6df0dc653dcc521350a26ab6e02e17ab4cb8147140c19aa6e108ae1493",
      "text": "If I'm to become an ordinary\ncitizen, I thought being like you\nwould be best. ...Am I right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:083349b3d37e12caa3c45427375fc9093529dbded98327d87d9dc9ef5e50a101",
      "text": "...Oh, I see...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9bde610eab6cd6d4ee668de7d2dee6734018524ef61211b4bb07248baa24c40b",
      "text": "You really did just want to\nbe our friend...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "207": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0fc24a8b16212a4e0d909a2d1a03ffd115973df4143cd81cfabb91b965ceab40",
      "text": "...? That's what ordinary\ncitizens do, isn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2ae0daff23b239d57cd90e4480abbc98027cf5c76d230f806289126382dff055",
      "text": "Guess there's just too much\nhe doesn't know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4a5a6ff39a2b705f1dd6b64217c914678a133b6e3a4bea00a621dea6c5d02bfc",
      "text": "Yeah... Maybe taking him around to\nall sorts of places would help?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a255e726d5653261b48fe3e3499a30ffcb6d9fe12bd70f6f950aef5421c6336d",
      "text": "Hm, I wonder if Light will mind?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a342a38e8365ecaa095257b61f4c68c0865c49ae2ebf0a1a73f0253c818ecd73",
      "text": "Him? Not a big deal at this point.\nLet's hit the dining hall for now.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "229": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a569bb21f73ba857b58d4a2be992148bbea21f06006b5f3af11fc7bc2d32e7b1",
      "text": "Why did you bring me here?\n...Isn't this place a secret?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:608dad5c405ea4bf739e6e50060a6a53c76b663b07fd01595fdb839f6690db17",
      "text": "Who knows.\nWhy not figure it out yourself?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fb96c76ec1ec5afb8d032afc3bfffd6581d5185af5fb74f9039ba7926e1eb641",
      "text": "..........\nI don't know...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
